            Version 1.1.1 — <time datetime="2026-08-21">August 21, 2026</time>
        </h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Amended CSS border radius variables so the component border radius could be changed with others in the same grouping.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
        <h3>
            Version 1.1.0 — <time datetime="2026-06-18">June 18, 2026</time>
        </h3>
        <ul>
            <li>
                Added a Replayable parameter to DebounceFilter for controlling whether validation
                announcements are logged to the announcement history.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
        <h3>
            Version 1.0.0 — <time datetime="2026-06-17">June 17, 2026</time>
        </h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Initial release of the <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">BlazorRamp.DebounceFilter v1.0.0</span> NuGet package, multi-targeting <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">.NET 8.0, .NET 9.0 & .NET 10.0</span></li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ol>

